truction Machinery has been developing its engineering capabilities in line with social development and manufacturing and advancing construction machinery, which supports the construction of social infrastructure, industry and residential houses around the world. About us Medium-term Management Plan Corporate Profile Creating the Future Through Innovation Meet expectations from customers, co-create innovative products, services, solutions and together, we continue to create new values. Our Business New Machinery We have been developing construction machinery through continuous innovation to deliver optimal solutions for our customers. Compact Compact machines boost productivity in tight spaces like urban sites, agriculture, and landscaping. Construction Advanced, eco-friendly machines meet diverse needs in infrastructure projects like roads and rivers. Mining Reliable mining machines enhance safety and productivity while reducing greenhouse gas emissions. Value Chain / Solutions We offer lifecycle services and business solutions to help our customers overcome challenges and achieve success. Parts & Service High-quality parts and ICT-based support using operational data help ensure stable machine operation. Rental Machines maintained by us and our dealers are provided as needed, helping improve productivity through reliable performance. Used Equipment As-is units and certified high-quality used equipment help support long-term operational reliability and value. Solutions Solutions to improve safety, productivity, and lifecycle cost efficiency help address operational challenges. Innovations Envisioning future job sites where work is safer and easier, enabled by efficient and accessible technologies. Our Innovations Sustainability Together with our stakeholders, we are committed to creating a more sustainable society. See Our Work Integrated Report Grow with Us Investor Relations Stay informed with key insights for investors. Investor Relations At a Glance Our Mining 